@startuml
!include ../../_style.puml
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
title One profile - retained configuration versions
actor Administrator
participant "Native history page" as UI
participant profile_history as History
participant profiles as Profiles
database "Profile / versions" as DB
participant "Core task queue" as Queue
Administrator -> UI : Compare two retained versions
UI -> DB : Read versions belonging to this profile
UI -> History : compare(before, after)
History --> UI : Field values / changed flags
UI -> UI : Escape values in native template
Administrator -> UI : Restore a historical configuration
UI -> History : restore(profileid, versionid) / session key
History -> DB : Read historical configuration for this profile
History -> Profiles : save(configuration, same profileid)
Profiles -> DB : Append version / set current under lock
Profiles -> Queue : Queue catalogue reconciliation
Profiles --> UI : Same profile / new current version
note over DB
Retention preserves the current version
and versions used by migration plans.
Export/import transports retained history
without database or actor IDs.
end note
@enduml
